Package: scikit-learn-termux
Version: 1.0.1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: termux-learn-crypto <vilasrmeshram400@gmail.com>
Depends: python, python-pip, python-numpy, python-scipy, clang, make, ninja, pkg-config, libopenblas, binutils
Section: python
Priority: optional
Description: scikit-learn for Termux - small ML models (chhote ML model)
 apt installs NumPy, SciPy and the compiler; the install step builds
 scikit-learn with pip (no Android wheel exists, takes 20-40 min).
 Commands: sklearn-setup (rebuild), sklearn-check.
